    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automatic approved-item production\nWorkflow 05 calls this workflow for every individual Idea Review approval. It locks the approved revision, discovers the exact requested MP4 in the configured Drive upload folder, refreshes matching approved screenshots, downloads them into persistent local mounts, validates names/MIME/duration/dimensions/hashes, and starts generation plus QA for only that content item.\n\nIf intake fails, the same Idea Review row becomes **Approved - Blocked** and records the exact reason. Workflow 05 retries blocked approvals every five minutes. Nothing is published here.",
